; The functions of kernel32.dll the native spec host imports on Windows
; (`os_windows.zig`), and nothing else: the runner links no C runtime and no
; other system library. The platform build makes the import library
; `targets/x64win/kernel32.lib` from this file with `zig dlltool`; keep it in
; step with the `extern "kernel32"` declarations there.
LIBRARY kernel32.dll
EXPORTS
CloseHandle
CreateFileW
CreatePipe
CreateProcessW
CreateThread
DuplicateHandle
ExitProcess
GetCommandLineW
GetCurrentProcess
GetExitCodeProcess
GetFileAttributesW
GetModuleFileNameW
GetProcessHeap
GetStdHandle
HeapAlloc
HeapFree
QueryPerformanceCounter
QueryPerformanceFrequency
ReadFile
SetErrorMode
SetHandleInformation
TerminateProcess
WaitForSingleObject
WriteFile
